  <para style="h">2 Jọn</para>
  <para style="toc1">Udiana Ñwed Jọn</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Jọn</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Jọn</para>
  <para style="mt1">Udiana Ñwed Jọn</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2JN 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2JN 1:1" />Ñwed emi oto Ada Idaha ufọk Abasi. Nnọ esọk edima eyenañwan emi Abasi emekde, ye mme nditọ esie, emi ami mmade ke esit akpanikọ. Idighe ami ikpọñ, edi kpukpru mme mmọ emi ediọñọde akpanikọ ema fi, <verse eid="2JN 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2JN 1:2" />koro akpanikọ oduñde ñnyin ke idem, ndien eyesuk oduñ ye ñnyin ke nsinsi. <verse eid="2JN 1:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2JN 1:3" />Abasi Ete ye Jisọs Kraist Eyen Esie, akpakam ọnọ ñnyin mfọn, mbọm, ye emem; mmọ ekpekam edu ye ñnyin ke akpanikọ ye ima.<verse eid="2JN 1:3" /></para>
  <para style="s1">Ekpeme mme Adausuñ Nsu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="4" style="v" sid="2JN 1:4" />Ekenem mi didie ndikut nte ke ubak nditọ fo edu uwem ke akpanikọ, kpa nte Ete okowukde ñnyin!<verse eid="2JN 1:4" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="5" style="v" sid="2JN 1:5" />Ndien ke ntre, ke ami mbeñe fi, edima eyen ete añwan nte, yak ñnyin kpukpru ima kiet eken. Emi idighe obufa ewuhọ ke ñwed nnọ fi; edi ewuhọ emi ñnyin ima ikenyenyene toto ke editọñọ. <verse eid="2JN 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2JN 1:6" />Ima emi ami ntiñde mbaña mi, ọwọrọ ete ñnyin inyene ndidu uwem ñnyin ke ñkopitem nnọ mme ewuhọ Abasi. Ewuhọ emi, nte kpukpru mbufo ekekopde toto ke editọñọ, edi ntem: Mbufo kpukpru enyene ndidu uwem ke ima.<verse eid="2JN 1:6" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="7" style="v" sid="2JN 1:7" />Mme ata ediwak mbon abiaña emewọñọ esuana eyọhọ ererimbot, mme mmọ oro minyimeke nditiñ ñwut nte ke Jisọs Kraist ama edi ke ikpọkidem. Utọ owo oro edi owo abiaña ye asua Kraist. <verse eid="2JN 1:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2JN 1:8" />Kpeme idem fo, ndien, mbak ududuọk se afo akanamde utom ọnọ, edi ọkpọbọ utib fo ọyọhọ ọyọhọ. <verse eid="2JN 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2JN 1:9" />Owo ekededi emi mikaha iso ye ukpepñkpọ Kraist, inyeneke Abasi. Owo ekededi emi akade iso ye ukpepñkpọ emi, enyene Ete ye Eyen.<verse eid="2JN 1:9" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2JN 1:10" />Edieke owo baba kiet edide ebine fi, ndien isañake ye ukpepñkpọ emi, kudara unyuñ uda enye usin ke ufọk fo, kudedei udọhọ enye ete, “Emem odu ye afo.”<verse eid="2JN 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2JN 1:11" />Koro owo ekededi emi oyomde emem ọnọ enye akabade edi nsaña esie ke mme oburobut ñkpọ emi enye anamde.<verse eid="2JN 1:11" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2JN 1:12" />Ami menyene ata ediwak mme ñkpọ emi ñkpetiñde ye afo, edi ami ndinamke ntre ke ediwewet ke babru ye mmọññwed, utu ke oro, ami mekere ndidi ndise fi ñnyuñ ñnyene nneme ye afo iso ye iso, man otodo ñnyin ikpokop inemesit ọyọhọ ọyọhọ.<verse eid="2JN 1:12" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2JN 1:13" />Mme nditọ edima eyen eka fo añwan enọ ekọm mmọ esọk fi.<verse eid="2JN 1:13" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2JN 1" />
</usx>